            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I kare meno jo me ot pa Icrael gulwoŋo nyiŋe ni manna. Onoŋo nen macalo nyig koo matar, ma mit malim, macalo nyim kic. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moses owacci, “Rwot ociko kit man ni, ‘Wek gigwok ma romo agwata moko kwon acel wa i kare pa likwayowu, wek gunen kit kwon ma yam apitowu kwede i tim, i kare ma yam akwanyowu iye woko ki lobo Ejipt.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.9.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ibru 9.4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moses owaco Aron ni, “Kwany abino, ci iony manna ma romo agwata moko kwon kacel, iket i nyim Rwot, wek obed me agwoka wa i kare pa likwayowu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Macalo Rwot ociko ki Moses, kit meno Aron oketo manna i nyim canduk lok me caden, wek obed me agwoka, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.16.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.16.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 16:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
